<h1>Reset your password</h1>
<p>Hi {{firstName}}, we got a request to reset the password of your Codeyoung account.</p>
<p class="actions"><a class="button" href="{{resetUrl}}">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p>The link works once and for {{validFor}}.</p>
<p class="muted">If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p>
